NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001553 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001554 "=head1 SPONSORS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001555 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001556 "The Perl Foundation L<https://www.perlfoundation.org/> sponsored this project"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001557 "(and the YAML Test Suite) with a grant of 2500 USD in 2017-2018."
